\title{ivreg2r: Extended Instrumental Variables Estimation with Diagnostics}
\description{
\if{html}{\figure{logo.svg}{options: style='float: right' alt='logo' width='120'}}

Comprehensive instrumental variables and GMM estimation with automatic diagnostics, inspired by Stata's 'ivreg2' (Baum, Schaffer & Stillman). Supports 2SLS, LIML, Fuller, k-class, two-step efficient GMM, and continuously-updated (CUE) estimators. Provides classical, robust, cluster-robust, HAC, and Driscoll-Kraay standard errors. Reports weak identification, underidentification, overidentification, and endogeneity tests at estimation time. All outputs are verified against Stata within tight numerical tolerances.
